WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,980
We are currently short of 300 units of wood.

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:02,980
Four hundred units of stone

3
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:03,980
Cut down trees and add glue

4
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,780
I can get about 80 units of wood in a day.

5
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,980
That means it takes four days

6
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:07,980
words of stone

7
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,380
We are too impatient here

8
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,580
I can only find someone to replace it.

9
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,580
I remember Brother Shitou was very short of meat.

10
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,380
We can let it grow more

11
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,180
Then give us some more at one time

12
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,580
Four hundred units of stone

13
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,180
No matter what, it will take six days.

14
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,780
Then we have nine days left

15
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:23,180
You have to spend half your time looking for heating supplies.

16
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,580
and plenty of food

17
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,380
Now we have nine hundred units of meat

18
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,780
As for meat, we can leave it alone for now.

19
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:35,290
Let's go look for some thermal supplies first. Well, I found them.

20
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:38,900
That should be the cabin of those two guys, huh?

21
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:39,900
Go over and have a look
